# Global instructions

Host-wide rules that hold in any repo, loaded by Antigravity (agy) in every
workspace. chezmoi generates this file. The shared rules and ponytail's
always-on ruleset are included live from `~/{{ $aw }}/instructions/global.md`
and the installed ponytail plugin; agy loads no rules from a plugin's root
AGENTS.md. Project-specific conventions belong in that project's own AGENTS.md,
not here.

